---
title: "borrow_flash_loan (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_whitelist: assert_whitelist_access(market, ctx)
    q_whitelist --> q_check_active: is_base_asset_active(market, coin_type)
    q_check_active --> q_borrow: base asset is active
    q_check_active --> q_abort_inactive: base asset not active
    q_abort_inactive --> [*]: abort base_asset_not_active_error
    q_borrow --> q_emit: (coin, receipt) = market::borrow_flash_loan(market, amount, ctx)
    q_emit --> [*]: return (coin, FlashLoan receipt)

    note right of q_borrow
        INV-001: FlashLoan receipt is a hot potato that must be consumed in same transaction
        INV-002: receipt contains original loan amount and fee
        INV-003: borrowed amount comes from market reserves
    end note
